<view class="header"><view class="header-brand">桂演<text>广西 · 全区</text></view><input class="search" placeholder="演出、场馆、艺人" value="{{keyword}}" bindinput="searchInput" bindconfirm="search" confirm-type="search"/></view><view class="hero"><image src="{{baseUrl}}/images/performance.png" mode="aspectFill"/><text>好戏广西，触手可及</text></view><view class="categories"><view class="category" wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="category"><view class="category-icon"><image src="/assets/{{item.id}}.png" style="width:42rpx;height:42rpx"/></view><text>{{item.name}}</text></view></view><view class="page"><view class="section-title">推荐资源<button class="text" bindtap="search">查看更多 ›</button></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在加载…</view><view class="resource" wx:for="{{resources}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><image src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="resource-info"><view class="resource-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="tags"><text class="tag" wx:for="{{item.tags}}" wx:for-item="tag" wx:key="*this">{{tag}}</text></view><view class="location">{{item.city}} · 演示资源</view><view class="price">{{item.priceText}}<text class="unit">/{{item.unit}}</text></view></view></view><view class="note">毕业实习演示 · 模拟数据与生成示意图</view></view>
